# # /restep/
#
# https://w3id.org/restep/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://restep.wubytes.com/
#
# Permanent identifiers for the Restep specification: its profile URIs,
# error types and JSON Schemas, under https://w3id.org/restep/1/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# - Manuel Albarran
#   - GitHub username: weapp
#   - GitHub organization: restep-spec

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://restep.wubytes.com/$1 [R=302,L]
